# (1.3, the Performance release) PERFORM (SEL): every key an effect while held, several together; the white keys
# four groups of four (rhythm, echo, space, colour: w0-w3, w4-w7, w8-w11, w12-w15), the black keys eleven more; REC
# as on any page; no mutes. At rest the screen is a map of the keys' effects. Keys whose effect 1.3 has yet to build are dark and do nothing (w0 Stutter here).
# (on Blasket, AISLING's: both sequences on, Sequence 2 a quieter echo of the first)
wait 500
turn PRESET 4
wait 300
expect piece 4
listen
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
said PERFORM ON
expect pheld 0
expect platch 0
expect litbtn14 0
# an effect, held: said, its key dark; let go: gone, lit again (w4, key 7: Repeat)
# (the flash: the header and the main area its colour and name while held, gone two frames after; every colour reads
# with black lettering at 4.5:1 or better, every name and line fits)
expect pfcontrast 0
expect pffit 0
expect pflash 0
expect litkey7 1
key w4 down
wait 300
said Repeat
expect pheld 128
expect litkey7 0
expect pflash 1
key w4 up
wait 500
expect pheld 0
expect litkey7 1
expect pflash 0
# two together (w8 Reverb, key 14; w13 Phaser, key 23)
key w8 down
key w13 down
wait 300
said Phaser
expect pheld 8404992
key w8 up
wait 100
expect pheld 8388608
key w13 up
wait 100
expect pheld 0
# one to come: dark, silent, nothing held
expect litkey0 0
key w0 down
wait 300
said_none Stutter
expect pheld 0
key w0 up
# Drop held (the top black key, b10: key 25): both sequences out, the Drone goes on
key b10 down
wait 300
said Drop
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 0
expect notes_ch4 0
key b10 up
wait 300
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 >0
# Rise (b3, key 8): a move, not one of the grid's (what it does to the filters: blackkeys.amb, on Aran)
key b3 down
wait 300
said Rise
expect pheld 256
key b3 up
wait 3000
# REC is as everywhere else (Stephen, 2026-11-10: no latch): a tap is the echo's Hold
tap REC
wait 300
expect frozen 1
tap REC
wait 300
expect frozen 0
expect platch 0
wait 300
expect pheld 0
# left with a key held: let go
key b10 down
wait 200
expect pheld 33554432
tap SEL
wait 300
said PERFORM OFF
expect pheld 0
expect platch 0
key b10 up
wait 300
expect bfx 0
peakreset
wait 6000
expect notes_ch2 >0
# a page's button leaves PERFORM
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
# (0.5) SEL again leaves it too, back to the page it came from: here the Drone's, then its sound page
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 1
said PERFORM OFF
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 8
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 8
